  "body": "This is a meta-issue to track requests to expand existing DOM APIs to cover shadow roots and related concepts (e.g. slotted elements, composed trees). \nTo keep the list manageable, only the top-level proposals for each feature are included, not individual low-level issues about ongoing work.\n\nExpand existing APIs to shadow Roots:\n\n- https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1287\n- https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1265\n- https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1189\n- https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1321\n- https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1395\n- https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1422\n\n\nExpand existing APIs to composed trees:\n\n- https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1214\n- https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/725\n- https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/463 (basically `querySelector()` on the composed tree)\n- https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1415\n\n",
